SUMMARY:Cardboard Jam Session
DESCRIPTION:Come for the whole session or drop in when you can\, Volunteers
  will be circulating if you get stuck partway through\, We will finish wit
 h a short show and tell for anyone who wants one\, Water and a snack are a
  good idea for a session this length\, This runs long so plan your schedul
 e around it\, A quieter corner is set aside for anyone who needs a break\,
  Bring a project you are already working on if you would rather\, We keep 
 the music low so conversation stays easy\, Photos are fine but please ask 
 the people in them first\, Leftover materials go back in the bin at the en
 d\, Bring a notebook and something to write with\, Everything you need is 
 provided at the table\, Newcomers are welcome and no experience is assumed
 \, We start with a short demonstration and then work at our own pace\, Sea
 ting is limited so arriving a few minutes early helps.
URL:https://tribeeventscon.example.org/panel/cardboard-jam-session-2/
LOCATION:Tabletop – Concept A
CATEGORIES:Convention Services,General (All Ages)
END:VEVENT
